flowchart TB
  accTitle: Truth and evidence storage
  accDescr: Accepted facts enter the canonical event log and replay into projections. Dialogue enters the transcript. Product-facing reasoning enters cognitive artifacts under policy. Full model-call evidence is indexed by manifests in Postgres and stored in private object storage. Checkpoints remain separate recovery candidates.

  Runtime["Game runtime"] -->|accepted facts| Events["Postgres: canonical events"]
  Runtime -->|explanatory records| Evidence["Postgres transcripts and cognition; Postgres manifests plus private object storage for raw traces"]
  Runtime -->|bounded runtime state| Checkpoint["Postgres: checkpoints and continuity"]

  Events --> Replay["Event replay"]
  Replay --> Projection["Board, watch, round, replay, and postgame projections"]
  Evidence --> Policy["Dialogue, artifact, and producer-trace access policies"]
  Checkpoint --> Recovery["Supported recovery gate"]

  Events -. exact accepted-action sequence when eligible .-> Evidence

  class Runtime runtimeNode
  class Events,Replay,Projection truthNode
  class Policy cognitionNode
  class Evidence evidenceNode
  class Checkpoint,Recovery recoveryNode

